{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0ZhdGhlciUyMFN0dSUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Father Stu","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pLAeWgqXbTeJ2gQtNvRmdIncYsk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rmhMB6KBxdSYatfiFoas60uF6Fc.jpg","description":"The true-life story of boxer-turned-priest. When an injury ends his amateur boxing career, Stuart Long moves to Los Angeles to find money and fame. While scraping by as a supermarket clerk, he meets Carmen, a Sunday school teacher who seems immune to his bad-boy charm. Determined to win her over, the longtime agnostic starts going to church to impress her. However, a motorcycle accident leaves him wondering if he can use his second chance to help others, leading to the surprising realization that he's meant to be a Catholic priest.\n\nRated R · Released 13 Apr 2022 · United States of America · Language: English · 124 min\nStudio: Municipal Pictures, Palm Drive Productions\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"124 min","cast":["Mark Wahlberg","Mel Gibson","Jacki Weaver","Teresa Ruiz","Malcolm McDowell","Annet Mahendru","Cody Fern","Winter Ave Zoli"],"director":["Rosalind Ross"],"released":"2022-04-13T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"God wanted a fighter… and He found one.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Rosalind Ross","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tylQhnZG5aWwgviKub8660HW3wF.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Wahlberg","character":"Father Stuart 'Stu' Long","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1Oc3XSLyb8hxmjmlgFENu582Kqw.jpg"},{"name":"Mel Gibson","character":"Bill Long","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jnqHMaOslt8cef2atSmOpGRvNla.jpg"},{"name":"Jacki Weaver","character":"Kathleen Long","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zalCqZnNQMKseFmwQwOlLrl3w2P.jpg"},{"name":"Teresa Ruiz","character":"Carmen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b